{"parse": {"title": "载波提箱", "pageid": 2266, "text": "<div class=\"mw-parser-output\"><div class=\"item-infobox\"><div style=\"position:absolute; width:100%; height:100%; overflow:hidden;\"><div class=\"glow-top\"><div></div></div><div class=\"glow-bottom\"><div></div></div></div><div class=\"item-infobox-box\"><div class=\"item-infobox-image\"><img alt=\"载波提箱\" src=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/e/e3/Item-481000.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"载波提箱\" width=\"256\" height=\"256\" class=\"img-fit mid-position\" data-file-width=\"256\" data-file-height=\"256\" /></div><div class=\"item-infobox-content\"><div class=\"serif\" style=\"font-size:22px\"><b>载波提箱</b><div class=\"hide-m test-hide grey-small\" style=\"float:right; font-family:sans-serif; font-size:16px\"><span class=\"no-select\">编号ID：</span>1#481002</div></div><hr /><div>隐隐传出乐声的手提箱，开启后可从中挑选指定的六星心相。</div><div style=\"color:#696969\">用于贮存已调制完成的影音信号的手提箱，收纳着一些长久回荡海面的旋律。</div><span class=\"item-infobox-subtitle\"><small class=\"serif\" style=\"white-space:nowrap; font-weight:bold; color:#555\">内含</small><hr class=\"inline\" /></span><table><tbody><tr><td class=\"source-text\"><span class=\"item-link\" data-itemid=\"1529\"><span class=\"item-link-frame\"><span class=\"item-link-rare\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%B8%90%E8%BF%91%E7%9A%84%E9%9B%A8%E5%A3%B0\" title=\"渐近的雨声\"><img alt=\"Bgequip6.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/08/Bgequip6.png/100px-Bgequip6.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\" class=\"img-fit notpageimage\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/08/Bgequip6.png/150px-Bgequip6.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/08/Bgequip6.png/200px-Bgequip6.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"256\" data-file-height=\"256\" /></a><span class=\"item-link-img\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%B8%90%E8%BF%91%E7%9A%84%E9%9B%A8%E5%A3%B0\" title=\"渐近的雨声\"><img alt=\"渐近的雨声\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d8/Equipment_icon-1529.png/100px-Equipment_icon-1529.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\" class=\"img-fit\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d8/Equipment_icon-1529.png/150px-Equipment_icon-1529.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d8/Equipment_icon-1529.png/200px-Equipment_icon-1529.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"248\" data-file-height=\"248\" /></a></span></span></span><span class=\"tooltips\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%B8%90%E8%BF%91%E7%9A%84%E9%9B%A8%E5%A3%B0\" title=\"渐近的雨声\">渐近的雨声</a><span class=\"tooltips-content\" style=\"text-align:left;\"><span class=\"item-infobox\"><span>记忆者使用单体反制至终的仪式后，使自身受创回复提升<span class=\"color-value\">10%</span>，持续2回合；记忆者反击造成的本源创伤提升<span class=\"color-value\">30%</span></span></span></span></span><span>&#160;</span><span class=\"item-link-count\" style=\"float:right\">×1</span></span></td><td class=\"source-text\"><span class=\"item-link\" data-itemid=\"1501\"><span class=\"item-link-frame\"><span class=\"item-link-rare\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E7%BE%8E%E4%B8%BD%E6%96%B0%E4%B8%96%E7%95%8C\" title=\"美丽新世界\"><img alt=\"Bgequip6.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/08/Bgequip6.png/100px-Bgequip6.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\" class=\"img-fit notpageimage\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/08/Bgequip6.png/150px-Bgequip6.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/08/Bgequip6.png/200px-Bgequip6.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"256\" data-file-height=\"256\" /></a><span class=\"item-link-img\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E7%BE%8E%E4%B8%BD%E6%96%B0%E4%B8%96%E7%95%8C\" title=\"美丽新世界\"><img alt=\"美丽新世界\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5a/Equipment_icon-1501.png/100px-Equipment_icon-1501.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\" class=\"img-fit\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5a/Equipment_icon-1501.png/150px-Equipment_icon-1501.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5a/Equipment_icon-1501.png/200px-Equipment_icon-1501.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"248\" data-file-height=\"248\" /></a></span></span></span><span class=\"tooltips\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E7%BE%8E%E4%B8%BD%E6%96%B0%E4%B8%96%E7%95%8C\" title=\"美丽新世界\">美丽新世界</a><span class=\"tooltips-content\" style=\"text-align:left;\"><span class=\"item-infobox\"><span>记忆者释放至终的仪式后，下次普通咒语的术法威力提升<span class=\"color-value\">20%</span></span></span></span></span><span>&#160;</span><span class=\"item-link-count\" style=\"float:right\">×1</span></span></td></tr><tr><td class=\"source-text\"><span class=\"item-link\" data-itemid=\"1502\"><span class=\"item-link-frame\"><span class=\"item-link-rare\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E8%B7%B3%E6%88%BF%E5%AD%90%E6%B8%B8%E6%88%8F\" title=\"跳房子游戏\"><img alt=\"Bgequip6.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/08/Bgequip6.png/100px-Bgequip6.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\" class=\"img-fit notpageimage\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/08/Bgequip6.png/150px-Bgequip6.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/08/Bgequip6.png/200px-Bgequip6.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"256\" data-file-height=\"256\" /></a><span class=\"item-link-img\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E8%B7%B3%E6%88%BF%E5%AD%90%E6%B8%B8%E6%88%8F\" title=\"跳房子游戏\"><img alt=\"跳房子游戏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/cd/Equipment_icon-1502.png/100px-Equipment_icon-1502.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\" class=\"img-fit\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/cd/Equipment_icon-1502.png/150px-Equipment_icon-1502.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/cd/Equipment_icon-1502.png/200px-Equipment_icon-1502.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"248\" data-file-height=\"248\" /></a></sp