om/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/08/Bgequip6.png/200px-Bgequip6.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"256\" data-file-height=\"256\" /></a><span class=\"item-link-img\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E5%BF%85%E8%A6%81%E7%9A%84%E8%AE%B0%E5%BD%95\" title=\"必要的记录\"><img alt=\"必要的记录\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/56/Equipment_icon-1510.png/100px-Equipment_icon-1510.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\" class=\"img-fit\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/56/Equipment_icon-1510.png/150px-Equipment_icon-1510.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/56/Equipment_icon-1510.png/200px-Equipment_icon-1510.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"248\" data-file-height=\"248\" /></a></span></span></span><span class=\"tooltips\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E5%BF%85%E8%A6%81%E7%9A%84%E8%AE%B0%E5%BD%95\" title=\"必要的记录\">必要的记录</a><span class=\"tooltips-content\" style=\"text-align:left;\"><span class=\"item-infobox\"><span>记忆者每击败1个敌方目标，回复自身攻击*<span class=\"color-value\">60%</span>的生命值</span></span></span></span><span>&#160;</span><span class=\"item-link-count\" style=\"float:right\">×1</span></span></td></tr></tbody></table></div></div></div></div>", "categories": [{"sortkey": "", "category": "物品"}], "displaytitle": "载波提箱"}}